            <tr><td>$100k+/mo, real SMS volume</td><td>Postscript for drops + Sequenzy lifecycle</td><td>Specialists per channel; caps enforced on a shared calendar</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Enterprise, multi-brand</td><td>Attentive with managed services</td><td>Governance and acquisition at scale justify the contract</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Subscriptions-heavy catalog</td><td>Any of the above + subscription-state suppression</td><td>Renewal timing owns the SMS slot; promos stay off renewal dates</td></tr>
